OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories about
OL,8,Fpeople, places and animals across our
OL,9,Fregion - and we like to shout about
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThis week, we're featuring a knighthood
OL,13,Ffor Sir Kevin Sinfield, a recue dog's
OL,14,Fchance at a new life, and an
OL,15,Fadventurer's 28-year journey coming to
OL,16,Fa close.
OL,18,FSir Kevin Sinfield has said his late
OL,19,Ffriend Rob Burrow would be "laughing"
OL,20,Fbut "enormously proud" to see him
OL,21,Freceive a knighthood.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
